      "title_text": "Form 26AS reports interest paid or credited by a party that the books do not match",
      "limits_sha256_16": "7a34bd470a4ea094",
      "limits_text": [
        "Tax on a supply falls due on credit or payment, whichever is earlier, so part of a difference can belong to an invoice of the previous or next year.",
        "Credit for tax deducted is allowed in the year the related income is offered (s.199); a 26AS amount with no matching income is a question about the income, not only the credit."
      ],
